# Demo cutscene for res://tests/demo/demo.tscn
# Enter / Space / click: advance text.  Hold Esc: skip.  R (after): replay.

fade out 0
fade in 1.2
say narrator "A quiet morning in the village."

move hero to well speed=walk
face mira hero
say mira "You came back." emotion=sad
face hero mira
say hero "I said I would. Didn't I?"
say mira "People say a lot of things."

wait 0.4
move mira to gate speed=run
face hero gate time=0.6
say hero "...Mira?"

fade out 1.0
